"test":{"name":"rule-faction-roster","kind":"rules","opponent":"Human","rounds":"4","check":"factionRoster","question":"Factions (Faction, Building.Offered): Blue's HQ and Factory keep their base lists. Given a faction that replaces the Grunt with its own version, drops the first other unit the HQ lists, and adds an extra unit made at Factories (the ArmyBase): the HQ offers the version where the Grunt was, not the Grunt or the dropped unit; the ArmyBase offers the version in its Grunt's place and the extra; without the faction, the base lists. The version is bought and placed under its own name, is allowed where the scenario allows the Grunt, and its name and the faction's survive a save (LevelEditor.loadUnit, PlayerData.factionName).","rules":"standard"},
